Description: Implements model-agnostic univariate Rank Graduation metrics for
    evaluating the accuracy, robustness, and explainability of predictive
    models. The core functions compare the orderings induced by two vectors
    through Lorenz, dual Lorenz, and concordance curve constructions. The
    package supports continuous and binary outcomes represented numerically or
    logically, ordinal outcomes represented as ordered factors, tie-aware
    calculations, and helpers for constructing the underlying curves. Model
    fitting, reduced-model construction, and robustness-scenario design remain
    separate from metric calculation.
